  "body": "WebIDL recently introduced dedicated syntax for mixins[1]. So, we can\nreplace `[NoInterfaceObject]` and `implements` with `interface mixin` and\n`includes`.\n\nTest: https://github.com/w3c/web-platform-tests/pull/8703\n\n[1] https://github.com/heycam/webidl/commit/45e8173d40ddff8dcf81697326e094bcf8b92920\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">/acknowledgements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/45364dd...caad0e4/acknowledgements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">/canvas.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/45364dd...caad0e4/canvas.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/45364dd...caad0e4/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/image-maps.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">/image-maps.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/45364dd...caad0e4/image-maps.html\" title=\"Last updated on Dec 20, 2017, 8:32 PM GMT (caad0e4)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/3207/index.html\" title=\"Last update